<title>FINLAND: IVO FINALISES GULLSPANG SHARES DEAL.</title>
<headline>IVO FINALISES GULLSPANG SHARES DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned power group Imatran Voima Oy (IVO) said in a statement on Thursday it had finalised a deal to buy all shares in its subsidiary Gullspangs Krat AB held by Sweden's Vattanfall AB thus raising its stake in Gullspang to 63.2 percent from 51.6 percent.</p>
<p>The deal was announced on May 20.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
